00:12:41.145 --> 00:12:43.124
being that the delta negative.

00:12:44.215 --> 00:12:47.625
molecule, or delta negative
atom, in this case fluorine,

00:12:48.035 --> 00:12:50.064
is receiving the hydrogen bond.

00:12:50.195 --> 00:12:53.905
So it's a further naming system, alright?

00:12:54.994 --> 00:12:59.544
The last type of
interaction is ion dipole.

00:13:00.174 --> 00:13:04.125
So you might be able to get
an idea of what ion dipole is.

00:13:04.125 --> 00:13:06.975
So the first part of the name, an ion.

00:13:07.455 --> 00:13:09.255
So you need something with a real charge.

00:13:09.635 --> 00:13:14.185
So one example of something with a
