00:13:44.935 --> 00:13:51.185
Well, the water would be the oxygen
side, which has the partial negative.

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:58.830
is going to be interacting with
the positive part of the sodium.

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:06.499
And we can draw a bunch of waters
all around that sodium interacting.

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:11.569
So when that happens, those
interactions are gonna surround

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:14.569
that part of that atom there.

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:19.240
And the same thing is going to happen
on the other side, but instead,

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:23.010
or if we have our chlorine, how
