00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:33.730
And you might be able to take a guess, is
that the hydrogen, in this case, is going

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:39.949
to interact with the other side because
hydrogen has the slightly positive side.

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:47.120
So when that happens, we're going to be
putting little positive hydrogens all

00:14:47.139 --> 00:14:58.939
