00:15:16.475 --> 00:15:17.395
It's actually pretty cool.

00:15:17.944 --> 00:15:20.865
So, that is ion dipole forces.

00:15:21.065 --> 00:15:24.465
So this is how attractions
occur between molecules.

00:15:24.895 --> 00:15:29.185
And one thing you're going to be
seeing is that like molecules, like

